We all gather in the meeting room for the morning meeting.
This is a short meeting.
Prakash is standing next to me.
Suresh asks everyone about their work.
Everyone speaks one by one.
I feel a little nervous.
Now it is my turn.
Suresh looks at me and asks.
"Maya, what is today's plan?"
I take a deep breath.
"I have read the new project's documents," I say.
"As a software engineer, I have checked its coding part."
"I have prepared a plan for my work."
I explain that plan to everyone.
Everyone nods.
Prakash smiles at me.
"That is a good plan, Maya," Suresh says.
My fear goes away.
Now I can start my work with confidence.
